# Branch protection must have "Require review from Code Owners" enabled for this to bind,
# and each team needs at least Write access to this repository. GitHub silently ignores an
# entry whose team has no access - the control fails open with no error anywhere.
#
# Every protected path has two owning teams on purpose: a pull request author never
# satisfies their own Code Owner review, so a single-team path stalls whenever that team
# is the author.

*                           @neotree/core-devs

/security/                  @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.github/workflows/         @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.github/actions/           @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.npmrc                     @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.yarnrc                    @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.yarnrc.yml                @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers
/.pnpmfile.cjs              @neotree/core-devs @neotree/maintainers

/.github/CODEOWNERS         @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/.github/dependabot.yml     @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/SECURITY.md                @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
